__TOC__
By now, hundreds of thousands of you have gotten stuck in to Leagues V: Raging Echoes! It's been fantastic to see so many players ticking off Tasks, agonising over area unlocks and racing towards new Relics, but with so many players getting hands-on comes fixes and tweaks galore!

This post is here to give you a rundown of all of the issues that we're hoping to hotfix either today (Thursday, November 28th) or tomorrow (Friday, November 29th). We've included all of the hotfixes that we made yesterday to make sure everybody's on the same page, and another table to let you know the kinds of fixes we're holding off on until next week's Game Update.

Before we get into table territory, we've got an update on yesterday's main game issues with dropped items disappearing. We believe we've identified any and all impacted UIM players and are working to restore any items lost as a result of deathpile deletion, as we've done in the past. We'll send you an Inbox message via your Message Centre when we're done, you won't need to reach out to us - we've got you covered! For players who lost Clue Scrolls that they'd dropped and been saving up, we're unfortunately not able to restore those and can only apologise for the inconvenience.

